    <item>
      <title>peoplebook</title>
      <link>https://peoplebook.dev-dot.li</link>
      <description>The devnet identity directory, where every handle has a claimable on-chain avatar NFT. Read live from the People chain: every person who registered a .dot-style handle gets a generated mask. Claim yours for 1 PAS and the PeoplebookAvatars contract (deployed on the devnet Asset Hub) mints an ERC-721 to you and rolls its rarity on chain, gacha-style: Legendary 3%, Epic 10%, Rare 20%, Uncommon 30%, Common 37%. The image is generated inside the contract, so the NFT shows in any wallet with nothing hosted anywhere. Own a .dot? Add it at claim and the contract verifies it against the registry for better odds. Searchable, self-updating as people claim.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">peoplebook</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 16:03:48 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
